$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are battling for control of the planet from their large aerial base complexes. Each airborne base is reached by a teleport pad located on small telepad bases on the ground. Each one is heavily guarded but once these facilities are taken they allow easy access to your opponents base. Look for the hidden elevator!";